# Learner-bound learning state.  This repository is publicly readable, and a
# learning trace (which nodes a named person failed, how often, which
# misconceptions recur) is a sensitive profile.  The store lives on disk under
# 08_Domain_Applications/Math_Mentor/learners/ so the Human can inspect it
# locally, but it must never enter public history.  Code and contracts are
# tracked; events and snapshots are not.
08_Domain_Applications/Math_Mentor/learners/

# Claude Code agent settings.
#
# settings.json is TRACKED: it carries the shared policy (permissions, deny
# rules) and reaches every domain through a core merge, so one edit in core
# updates all of them.
#
# settings.local.json is NOT tracked. It holds one machine's personal choices -
# model, effort, thinking budget. It was tracked by mistake, which is how one
# person's 16k always-on thinking budget ended up cloned into every domain
# repository.
.claude/settings.local.json
